                <pb facs="0420" n="314" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg314"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Minister Rockhill.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-12-04"><hi rendition="#italic">December 4,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Root tells Mr. Rockhill, unless he sees reasons to the contrary, to instruct
                    Consul-General Lay according to the wishes of the latter.)</p>
            </div>
